# Glimmerlight: "When this Equipment enters, create a 1/1 white Glimmer enchantment creature token." (CR 111.1), "Equipped
# creature gets +1/+1." and "Equip {1}" (CR 702.6a, 301.5). Turn 1: two Moxen pay for it; the trigger makes a Glimmer
# (1/1 white enchantment creature) which the Equip, paid with exactly one Mox Pearl (the pool empty right after), makes a 2/2.
# On Bot2's turn 2, with a Mox untapped to pay, an equip is refused at instant speed (Bot2's Ornithopter spell
# is on the stack), and on turn 3 Bot2's own Ornithopter is not a target; the equip moves to Bot1's Ornithopter and the
# Glimmer goes back to 1/1 while the Ornithopter becomes 1/3.

